	"/helpticket note [ticket userid], [note] - Adds a note to the [ticket], to be displayed in the hover text. Requires: % @ ~": "/helpticket note [identifiant du ticket], [note] - Ajoute une note au [ticket], affichée au survol. Requiert : % @ ~",
	"Specify the userid that created the ticket you want to remove a note from.": "Indiquez l'identifiant de l'auteur du ticket dont vous voulez retirer une note.",
	"{targetId} does not have a pending ticket.": "{targetId} n'a pas de ticket en attente.",
	"{targetId}'s ticket does not have any notes.": "Le ticket de {targetId} n'a aucune note.",
